    "Description": "### Impact\n\nAn attacker who uses this vulnerability can craft a PDF which leads to large memory consumption. This requires parsing the `/ToUnicode` entry of a font with unusually large values, for example during text extraction.\n\n### Patches\n\nThis has been fixed in [pypdf==6.18.1](https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/releases/tag/6.18.1).\n\n### Workarounds\n\nIf you cannot upgrade yet, consider applying the changes from PR [#4071](https://github.com/py-pdf/pypdf/pull/4071).",
